<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
We want our customers to have an exceptional experience each time they fly with us, so I was sorry to hear about your&nbsp;<strong>&lt;enter issue/in-flight/dining/aircraft/service/etc&gt;.</strong><br />
<br />
From the menus we curate to the training of our cabin crew, we strive to offer the best service in the aviation industry.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed on your feedback to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience — we hope to welcome you onboard again soon.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If mishandled by another airline at check in :</strong></em><br />
<br />
We want our customers to have an exceptional experience each time they fly with us, so I was sorry to hear about your&nbsp;<strong>&lt;enter other air;one flight details&gt;.</strong><br />
<br />
As your flight in this case was operated by another airline you will need to raise this directly with the airline.</p>

<p>Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience — we hope to welcome you onboard soon.</p>
